  + [interpretation_boundary] the three outputs share one semantic front end but never share execution authority merely because they share SOP source

& [Purpose]
  + activate only the strict inert machine forms required to identify an SOP seed backend-neutral typed IR one-backend candidate plan capability receipt and self-assembly ledger
  + make backend separation source mapping capability ceilings unresolved conditions external recognition and rollback machine-checkable before any compiler emits an artifact

& [BackendSet]
  + attention_procedure projects explicit model-host attention procedure candidates
  + inference_host_integration projects external adapters or later separately justified version-pinned llama.cpp internal addons
  + native_artifact projects conventional external binary library service CLI and later separately activated hardware candidates
  + exactly one backend belongs to each candidate plan

& [Forms]
  + SOPSeed binds profile seed generation purpose external trust-root references dependency roots discovery and compiler profiles capability ceiling predecessor and successor policy
  + TypedSopIr binds source manifest canonical specification semantic addresses typed semantic nodes dependency edges source map unresolved account and non-authority statement
  + CandidateCompilationPlan binds one seed one IR one backend exact requested capabilities inputs outputs verifiers rollback unresolved account and non-authority statement
  + CompilerCapabilityReceipt binds one plan to its ceiling admitted and denied capabilities evidence and disposition without authorizing execution
  + SelfAssemblyLedger orders self_description self_ordering self_hosting and self_revision observations and requires Honesty Security and external-recognition references before a successor can be marked recognized

& [Validation]
  + all profiles identities purposes references digests maps sets and cardinalities are finite nonblank canonical and closed to unknown JSON fields
  + semantic node dependencies must resolve and the node graph must be acyclic
  + requested and admitted capabilities must remain subsets of the exact seed ceiling and denied capabilities equal the requested difference
  + plan backend profile must equal the exact profile registered by the seed for that backend
  + backend identity digest source IR plan receipt and ledger digests are domain-separated and recomputable
  + self-assembly stages are monotonic and cannot skip directly to a recognized successor

& [Acceptance]
  + valid fixtures for all three backends serialize deterministically and validate
  + cross-backend substitution digest mutation missing source map dependency cycle capability excess and false successor recognition fail closed
  + JSON unknown fields reject
  + focused debug optimized release complete workspace warnings-denied Clippy format evidence and diff gates pass

